cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "policy-corpus-builder"
abstract: >-
  Reusable tooling for policy document retrieval, normalization, and corpus
  export. Provides a config-driven CLI and Python API with an adapter system
  covering EUR-Lex, EUR-Lex NIM (national implementing measures), non-EU
  jurisdictions (UK, Canada, Australia, US, New Zealand), and local-file
  sources, for building reproducible policy-document corpora for research.
authors:
